    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must stay alive in this horror endless school. Try to find the correct way to survive the anomalies in the endless school. Use your brain to escape from some extremely powerful anomalies bosses. Explore the story behinds this extremely powerful dimension... and don't die. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome Back to School!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn back if you find any anomalies.</strong> You are waked in an endless school. You have to choose the way forward or backward. When you make the wrong decision, you will return to the origin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802820/extras/8e9c11d86cd3707cf08fbfcb840cfd96.poster.avif?t=1749986324\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802820/extras/8e9c11d86cd3707cf08fbfcb840cfd96.webm?t=1749986324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802820/extras/8e9c11d86cd3707cf08fbfcb840cfd96.mp4?t=1749986324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Uniques Anomalies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anything can become an anomaly.</strong> Every chair around you, every set of stationery, even the blackboard or the classroom itself can become an anomaly you didn't expect. You might be scared to death by these anomalies or laugh to death from them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802820/extras/7bbcbb95f11382ccb5f5efa69a08404d.poster.avif?t=1749986324\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802820/extras/7bbcbb95f11382ccb5f5efa69a08404d.webm?t=1749986324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802820/extras/7bbcbb95f11382ccb5f5efa69a08404d.mp4?t=1749986324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Abnormal Dimensions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extremely abnormal anomalies are looking for you.</strong> Every time you pass the six normal levels, you'll be pulled into their dimension by some powerful anomaly. Each dimension has different game rules. You need to find these game rules and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802820/extras/dcb4b0d81a9da3d26ccb12ace3bc6634.poster.avif?t=1749986324\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802820/extras/dcb4b0d81a9da3d26ccb12ace3bc6634.webm?t=1749986324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802820/extras/dcb4b0d81a9da3d26ccb12ace3bc6634.mp4?t=1749986324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------------------------------- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>School 666</strong> is a co-op horror game about finding anomalies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In normal levels, players need to confirm whether there is any abnormality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there is an exception, go back along the way; if there is no exception, go forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Boss level, players need to find a way to escape according to the unique game rules of each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features more than 100 anomalies and more than 20 stages of abnormal dimensions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game pays tribute to many game and movie elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Average game time: 6-10 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Press Kits and Other Assets<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you need my permission to live stream this game, as long as you attach the game name(School 666) to the video introduction or stream description, you will automatically be authorized(including videos and live broadcasts used for profit).</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must stay alive in this horror endless school. Try to find the correct way to survive the anomalies in the endless school. Use your brain to escape from some extremely powerful anomalies bosses. Explore the story behinds this extremely powerful dimension... and don't die. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome Back to School!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn back if you find any anomalies.</strong> You are waked in an endless school. You have to choose the way forward or backward. When you make the wrong decision, you will return to the origin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802820/extras/8e9c11d86cd3707cf08fbfcb840cfd96.poster.avif?t=1749986324\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802820/extras/8e9c11d86cd3707cf08fbfcb840cfd96.webm?t=1749986324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802820/extras/8e9c11d86cd3707cf08fbfcb840cfd96.mp4?t=1749986324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Uniques Anomalies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anything can become an anomaly.</strong> Every chair around you, every set of stationery, even the blackboard or the classroom itself can become an anomaly you didn't expect. You might be scared to death by these anomalies or laugh to death from them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802820/extras/7bbcbb95f11382ccb5f5efa69a08404d.poster.avif?t=1749986324\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802820/extras/7bbcbb95f11382ccb5f5efa69a08404d.webm?t=1749986324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802820/extras/7bbcbb95f11382ccb5f5efa69a08404d.mp4?t=1749986324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Abnormal Dimensions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extremely abnormal anomalies are looking for you.</strong> Every time you pass the six normal levels, you'll be pulled into their dimension by some powerful anomaly. Each dimension has different game rules. You need to find these game rules and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802820/extras/dcb4b0d81a9da3d26ccb12ace3bc6634.poster.avif?t=1749986324\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802820/extras/dcb4b0d81a9da3d26ccb12ace3bc6634.webm?t=1749986324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802820/extras/dcb4b0d81a9da3d26ccb12ace3bc6634.mp4?t=1749986324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------------------------------- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>School 666</strong> is a co-op horror game about finding anomalies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In normal levels, players need to confirm whether there is any abnormality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there is an exception, go back along the way; if there is no exception, go forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Boss level, players need to find a way to escape according to the unique game rules of each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features more than 100 anomalies and more than 20 stages of abnormal dimensions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game pays tribute to many game and movie elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Average game time: 6-10 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Press Kits and Other Assets<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you need my permission to live stream this game, as long as you attach the game name(School 666) to the video introduction or stream description, you will automatically be authorized(including videos and live broadcasts used for profit).</p>",
